#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:66 cc895f357f004839837b3d99e11ff6af
msgid "Unlocks the sound data, allowing FMOD to resume normal processing."
msgstr "解锁声音数据，允许 FMOD 恢复正常处理，在访问数据完成后应立即调用此函数"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:68 5565a543c54a45618279ab389e56acd5
msgid "This should be called as soon as you're finished accessing the data."
msgstr "完成数据访问后应尽快调用。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:70 18c57b20bf60435195a82b7b5c2cce8f
msgid "The destructor automatically calls this if the data is still locked."
msgstr "对象析构时若仍处于锁定状态，会自动调用此方法。"

