#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:116 00c11c1d313e40af9a72c3ef77c07bef
msgid "Returns ``true`` if the sound data is currently locked and accessible."
msgstr "如果声音数据当前被锁定并且可访问，则返回    ``true``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:14 3d64ec8cf305499db1bb7ec280ababcf
msgid "Locks sound sample data and exposes copies for reading."
msgstr "锁定声音采样数据，并提供可读取的副本。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:21 8c74be2a0c6b43c788d872ed20f5c6fc
msgid ""
"FmodSoundLock locks a region of sound data and copies its contents into "
":ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>` values returned by "
":ref:`get_data1()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_get_data1>` and "
":ref:`get_data2()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_get_data2>`. Editing these arrays does not write"
" back to the sound."
msgstr ""
"FmodSoundLock 锁定声音数据区域，并将内容复制到  :ref:`get_data1()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_get_data1>`  和  "
":ref:`get_data2()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_get_data2>`  返回的  "
":ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>`  中。修改这些数组不会写回声音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:23 6dc52fcb812f4a269e8bee680e010f00
msgid "A locked region can have two portions if it wraps around the end of the sound buffer."
msgstr "锁定区域跨越声音缓冲区末尾时，数据会分为两部分。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:25 bccaf948c9f947138a2d9ed882624237
msgid ""
"Keep the source :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>` alive until "
":ref:`unlock()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_unlock>` is called. The lock stores a native "
"pointer and does not retain the sound wrapper."
msgstr ""
"调用  :ref:`unlock()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_unlock>`  前必须保持源  "
":ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`  存活。锁对象只保存原生指针，不会持有声音包装器的引用。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:27 fcad0573caad40c086a95cd7a6275f19
msgid ""
"Call :ref:`unlock()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_unlock>` when finished. Destroying the lock "
"object also unlocks the region."
msgstr "读取完成后调用  :ref:`unlock()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_unlock>` 。销毁锁对象也会解锁该区域。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:78 45d5a4b18d5043c0b9a5d58e5b736cb6
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the first portion of the locked data. Returns an empty array after "
"unlocking. Editing the returned array does not modify the sound."
msgstr "返回锁定数据第一部分的副本。解锁后返回空数组。修改返回数组不会修改声音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:90 a91c45abc4a04c65817e266608e7696a
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the second portion of the locked data, which is present only when the "
"region wraps around the end of the sound buffer. Returns an empty array after unlocking. "
"Editing the returned array does not modify the sound."
msgstr "返回锁定数据第二部分的副本，仅当区域跨越声音缓冲区末尾时存在。解锁后返回空数组。修改返回数组不会修改声音。"
